### UniBite — Test: POST /api/listings/create
### Run the requests top-to-bottom. The IntelliJ HTTP Client keeps the session
### cookie from request #1 and sends it automatically to #2 and #3.

### 1) Login first (sets the PHPSESSID cookie)
POST http://localhost/unibite/api/auth/login.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "dimitris",
  "password": "unibite2025"
}

### 2) Create a listing WITHOUT a photo (the common case)
POST http://localhost/unibite/api/listings/create.php
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Φασολάδα της γιαγιάς
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Χορτοφαγική, μόλις μαγειρεμένη.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="portions"

4
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_location_text"

Κτίριο Β, Πανεπιστήμιο Πατρών
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lat"

38.2880
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lng"

21.7890
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_from"

2026-06-04T12:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_to"

2026-06-04T15:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="allergen_ids[]"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="allergen_ids[]"

7
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3) (optional) Create a listing WITH a photo
### Point the "< path" line to a real image on your machine before running.
POST http://localhost/unibite/api/listings/create.php
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Μουσακάς
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="portions"

6
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_location_text"

Εστία 3, δωμάτιο 210
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lat"

38.2900
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lng"

21.7900
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_from"

2026-06-04T18:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_to"

2026-06-04T20:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\YourUser\Pictures\test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4) Negative test: missing title + bad portions => expect 400 with fields{}
POST http://localhost/unibite/api/listings/create.php
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="portions"

0
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_location_text"

Κάπου
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lat"

38.29
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_lng"

21.79
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_from"

2026-06-04T18:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pickup_time_to"

2026-06-04T17:00
--WebAppBoundary--
